# Owned by this role, not read from the Docker role's templates like the rest of this
# Secret's keys are — it diverged, and the Docker copy has since been deleted.
#
# That copy pointed Homepage's docker-proxy status dots at `my-docker` (docker-proxy on
# the Docker network). There is no k8s equivalent yet — a kubernetes-widget-backed status dot
# is a later decision — so this renders empty. services.yaml.j2 (also this role's own) drops
# the matching `server:`/`container:` keys so tiles render dot-less instead of erroring on a
# `my-docker` host that doesn't exist here.
